{"id":"4b6f333a5d94c1f0","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-no-optimal-effective-martingale.md","title":"有效鞅不存在乘法最优者","display":"thm-no-optimal-effective-martingale — 有效鞅不存在乘法最优者","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-no-optimal-effective-martingale","aliases":["43-thm-no-optimal-effective-martingale"],"display":"thm-no-optimal-effective-martingale — 有效鞅不存在乘法最优者","depends_on":["[[43-df-effective-martingale]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.1.3 Theorem 10.1.14，印刷212–213，PDF232–233","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-no-optimal-effective-martingale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-no-optimal-effective-martingale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-no-optimal-effective-martingale — 有效鞅不存在乘法最优者"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca2fbe2bdf667589\" href=\"?note=ca2fbe2bdf667589\" title=\"43-df-effective-martingale\">43-df-effective-martingale</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.1.3 Theorem 10.1.14，印刷212–213，PDF232–233"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,g\">\\(d,g\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2fbe2bdf667589\" href=\"?note=ca2fbe2bdf667589\" title=\"43-df-effective-martingale\">43-df-effective-martingale</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}(d)\\Rightarrow\\exists g:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}(g)\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;g(\\sigma)&gt;c\\,d(\\sigma)\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}(d)\\Rightarrow\\exists g:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}(g)\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;g(\\sigma)&gt;c\\,d(\\sigma)\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>与有效上鞅最优性以及有效鞅成功集通用性并不冲突。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.1.3 Theorem 10.1.14，印刷212–213，PDF232–233。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-effective-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"ca2fbe2bdf667589","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"ca2fbe2bdf667589","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$d,g$ 遍历 $2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；$\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}$ 见 [[43-df-effective-martingale]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"d,g","display":false},{"tex":"2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}(d)\\Rightarrow\\exists g:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}(g)\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;g(\\sigma)>c\\,d(\\sigma)\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1289,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-223","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-no-optimal-effective-martingale]] — 有效鞅不存在乘法最优者"}],"outgoing":["ca2fbe2bdf667589"]}